{
    "_id": "autoretrato",
    "name": "Autoretrato",
    "instructions": "1. Combine all of the ingredients in a cocktail shaker.\n2. Dry shake to emulsify the egg whites.\n3. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n4. Double strain into a chilled cocktail glass.\n5. Garnish with a half of passion fruit, mint leaf and a dried clover blossom.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "description": "Autoretrato is a tropical riff on the modern classic Amaretto Sour, reinvented for a different audience. The spirit base is pisco, which offers distinct grape notes, subtle floral and fruity flavors that pair well with the sweet, nutty amaretto. Passion fruit pulp gives the drink a tiki-like direction with a balanced sweet-tart fruitiness, while agave nectar and lemon juice add a floral tartness. Egg whites provide a foamy, decadent texture. It is a deliciously complex and fruity cocktail, suitable for garden parties and summer gatherings.",
